<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/25/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Consumer Protection Act 1999 [Act 599 ], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in subsection 99(1) by inserting after paragraph (c) the following paragraph: “ (ca) which may be lodged by a consumer relating to aviation service as defined in the Malaysian Aviation Commission Act 2015 [Act …];”. Saving and transitional provisions"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/25/eng@> .
