<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/25/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any right, obligation, liability, penalty or award acquired, imposed, accrued, incurred or made under the principal Act in relation to a consumer claim relating to aviation service shall not be affected by this Act and shall continue to remain in force as if section 99 of the principal Act had not been amended by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/25/eng@> .
